  "verified_facts": [
    "Lavdv.an builds distinct UI and legacy-map lists; with cfxa.H enabled and chaq.b bit0 set, an ordinary place is present in UI list A but omitted from legacy map list B.",
    "Lavdv.j exposes ae-derived places only; Laveg.d uses that list for fallback, not the complete response/UI result list.",
    "Laveg.c selects fallback when native cbkh is null and clears native SEARCH_RESULTS_LAYER before invoking Layxa.V or clearing the legacy renderer.",
    "Layxa.V deduplicates by low64 CID and aM skips deduplicated sizes <=1. Items with null legacy coordinates are skipped.",
    "Laveh.c uses cbkh.e size to select normal empty/nonempty layer type and passes the same cbkh object to the layer backend.",
    "Lbehy.v derives a layer identity string from cbkh.hashCode and does not create or fetch result features.",
    "Inspected old-backend config/caching/request writer paths pass the supplied cbkh to chsl extension 299174093 without retrieving an independent unfiltered SearchResult list."
